# WolvenKit intermediates and build output
**/source/wkit/_generated/
**/source/wkit/**/packed/
**/source/wkit/packed/*.archive
**/source/wkit/packed/*.archive.xl
*.csv.bak
*.kark

# Extracted base-game data is CACHE, never committed. It is game content pulled
# out of the archives with WolvenKit and is rebuilt on demand: _anchor_cache by
# tools/find_pin_anchors.py, _vo_cache by tools/vo_corpus.py, _lipsync_cache by
# `gen_lipsync.py --rebuild` (about 40 seconds).
#
# Shipping extracted game data is what gets a mod taken down. Do not commit it.
tools/_anchor_cache/
tools/_vo_cache/
tools/_lipsync_cache/
**/source/wkit/_research/
**/source/audio/**/*.Ogg
**/source/audio/**/*.ogg

# Release artifacts
/dist/

# Audio working files. The .wem that ship are tracked; these are not.
**/source/audio/placeholder/
**/source/audio/audition/
**/source/audio/reference/

# Credentials. Never committed, never echoed, never passed as a command-line
# argument, because arguments show up in shell history.
.secrets/
.env

# C++ build output for the native plugin. The source stays tracked; it is kept
# as a working RED4ext + MASM scaffold for future native work.
tools/native/**/build/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
*.log
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
~$*
